# Playwright / Prism Conventions

## Layout

- `pages/` — Page Object Model (extend `BasePage`)
- `tests/ui/smoke|regression/` — UI specs tagged `@smoke` / `@regression`
- `tests/api/smoke|regression/` — `*.api.spec.js` for API project
- `data/` — `ui-test-data.js`, `api-test-data.js` (single source of test data)
- `fixtures/` — `test-fixtures.js`, `api-fixtures.js`
- `api/` — `ToolshopApiClient`, `api-assertions.js`

## UI tests

- Import `test`/`expect` from `fixtures/test-fixtures.js`, not `@playwright/test` directly.
- Map `describe` blocks to manual TC IDs (e.g. `TC-M-02`).
- Selectors: prefer `data-test` (`testIdAttribute` in config).
- Logout: account menu → **Sign out** text (`BasePage.logout()`).

## API tests

- Use `ToolshopApiClient` + `api-assertions.js` — assert only OpenAPI-confirmed fields.
- Invoice create expects **201** (not 200). Use profile-mapped billing for `POST /invoices`.
- API project runs with `workers: 1` in `playwright.config.js`.

## Assertions

- Strengthen checkout: qty update, cart total, new invoice detection, invoice detail page line items.
- Do not swallow invoice POST failures silently — capture status when observable.

## Caps

Assessment guideline: 5–8 automated tests per layer (smoke + regression combined). Current: 9 UI + 9 API — document if adding specs.
